"""Signing in by email (4 November 2026, `rouh/models/signin.py`): three tables, and every active
account's own email as its first sign-in address, so nobody who signs in today is left out when the
sign-in page asks for an email. An account with no email, or with one another account already
holds, gets none here; its username is still its way in with a password.

Running it again adds nothing.
"""
